        "abstract": "Multimedia is currently underrepresented in the Web of Data. This is due to the lack of integrated means to describe, publish, and interlink multimedia content. This paper presents a framework for the publication of media content and its metadata as Linked Data, the Linked Media Framework (LMF). The LMF enables to store and retrieve content and metadata for media resources and resource fragments in a unified way.",
